name: Completed matrix recovery awaits Scan acceptance and feeds ordinary Report
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/matrix_handoff.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed @TMP_HOME @REPO/target/debug/kuzushi
launch: --target @ART/current-target
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: workbench
require-live-snap: 25 RESULT READY | pending-result
nav-mode:
live-snap: unselected-scan
expect: NAVIGATE
ask: Does recovered matrix work show a completed but unselected Scan result with an explicit Use action, without claiming Review is complete?
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/matrix_handoff.py @TMP_TARGET @ART unselected
resize: 40x12
require-live-snap: 20 RESULT | unselected-scan-40x12
ask: At 40x12, are Use Scan and Use & Review distinct and reachable without obscuring the pending outcome?
resize: 120x36
keys: u
require-live-snap: 25 result selected | selected-scan
expect: Viewing Scan
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/matrix_handoff.py @TMP_TARGET @ART selected
ask: Does explicit Use Scan remove the pending decision and retain the durable selected outcome and its actual run references?
keys: Escape
submit: report
require-live-snap: 25 Context cases: 3 | ordinary-matrix-report
expect: 6 raw observations
expect: observed 3 / 3
expect: observed 2 / 3
expect: observed 1 / 3
ask: Does ordinary Report use the accepted matrix, separate recurrence, distinguish zero provider calls from unavailable run costs, and avoid mixing workspace history?
resize: 80x24
keys: Home
live-snap: report-80x24
resize: 60x20
keys: Home
live-snap: report-60x20
resize: 40x12
keys: Home
live-snap: report-40x12
keys: End
live-snap: report-tail-40x12
keys: PgUp PgUp PgUp PgUp PgUp PgUp
live-snap: report-cases-40x12
keys: PgDn PgDn
require-live-snap: 20 Shared allowance: | report-budget-40x12
keys: PgDn
live-snap: report-cost-40x12
ask: Are case identity, spending and persistent export controls readable through keyboard paging at narrow sizes without starting further work?
resize: 120x36
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME NO_COLOR=1 KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
launch: --target @ART/current-target
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
submit: report
require-live-snap: 25 Context cases: 3 | recovered-report
expect: 6 raw observations
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/matrix_handoff.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restarted
ask: Does no-color restart retain one selected Scan attempt and recover the same matrix report with no duplicate attempt, new job or extra spending?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
